Fixed in "[PATCH v2] claude: Treat unintegrated mail as revisable
drafts" [2]. Replies may still be revised in place until you integrate
them. A posted series never is, even as a draft. If it needs to change,
the next version goes out with -v N and a link to the previous one.
zib/patch-review-workflow.org says the same.

